  "brain_first": "“先找发生了什么，再找为什么；原因可能在前，也可能在 后。”",
  "sort_order": 1008,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 355
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Why...? / What is the purpose of the call/visit?",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 356
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 357
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "原因题要找因果链，目的题要找人物想达成的结",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 358
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "果。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 359
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先找发生了什么，再找为什么；原因可能在前，也可能在",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 360
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "后。”",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 361
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 录音中 because, since, so, to, in order to 是明确信号，但也可能不出现连接",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 362
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "词。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 363
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 364
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先把题干主语圈出来，确定“谁的原因”。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 365
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 听动作/事件：打电话、迟到、取消、抱怨、请求。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 366
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 找到解释该动作的直接原因，不要选更远的背景。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 367
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 目的题把答案改写成“X did this in order to ___”检查是否自然。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 368
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 369
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 370
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 371
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Why call? → 通常答案是电话要解决的事情",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 372
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Why late? → 找导致迟到的直接事件",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 373
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 目的 ≠ 结果；“想做什么”与“最后发生什么”可能不同",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 374
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 一个选项能完整解释题干动作，而且没有额外脑补。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 375
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果听到多个原因，优先找与题干动作直接相连的那一个。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 376
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 377
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I'm calling because tomorrow's meeting conflicts with a medical appointment. Could we move it to",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 378
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Friday?",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 379
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "目的：postpone/reschedule the meeting；不是“看医生”本身。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 380
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 381
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把背景信息当直接原因。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 382
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把结果当目的。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 383
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 384
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 答案能放进 “because...” 吗？",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 385
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 是否回答了题干那个具体动作？",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 386
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 387
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 388
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 389
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 原因找直接链，目的看想达成什么。",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 390
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 392
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “I’m calling to change my reservation.”电话目的？",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 393
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. “She was late because the bus broke down.”直接原因？",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 394
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 目的题“去医院”与“打电话改会议”同时出现，题问call purpose应选？",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 395
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. Why did he leave early? 文章说he felt sick. 答案？",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 396
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 原因题若有背景原因和直接原因，优先哪一个？",
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "sourceIndex": 397
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. change/reschedule the reservation；2. bus broke down；3. 改会议。；4. because he felt sick；",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 398
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 与题干动作直接相连的原因。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 399
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L5 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L5”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 400
    }
  ],
